## Code (minimal)

```python
from langgraph.checkpoint.memory import MemorySaver

memory = MemorySaver()
graph = graph_builder.compile(checkpointer=memory)
config = {"configurable": {"thread_id": "1"}}

# --- values mode: full accumulated state after each step ---
for event in graph.stream({"messages": ["Hi, my name is Vivek"]}, config, stream_mode="values"):
    event["messages"][-1].pretty_print()

# --- updates mode: only what changed in that step ---
for event in graph.stream({"messages": ["What's my name?"]}, config, stream_mode="updates"):
    print(event)

# --- async version ---
# async for event in graph.astream({"messages": ["Hi"]}, config, stream_mode="values"):
#     print(event)
```

